OL,3,GNEWSATroubled school making
OL,4,Aimprovements, Oftsed says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA school that was put into special
OL,7,Fmeasures and where staff went on strike
OL,8,Fover poor pupil behaviour has started
OL,9,Fto improve, the regulator Oftsed has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FHaydon Bridge High School in
OL,13,FNorthumberland was found to need
OL,14,Fattention or urgent improvement across
OL,15,Fseveral areas following a full
OL,16,Finspection in January, with the former
OL,17,Fhead teacher stepping down in April.
OL,19,FAn interim executive board was put in
OL,20,Fplace by the county council and the
OL,21,Fschool is now receiving support from a
OL,22,Flocal multi-academy trust.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
